### 정상 승인
POST {{pg-simulator}}/api/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 10000
}

### 지연 재현 (3초)
POST {{pg-simulator}}/api/v1/transactions?delayMs=3000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 10000
}

### 강제 실패
POST {{pg-simulator}}/api/v1/transactions?forceFail=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 10000
}

### 확률적 실패 (50%) - Circuit Breaker sliding window 관찰용
POST {{pg-simulator}}/api/v1/transactions?failureRate=0.5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 10000
}
